{ (THIS IS STILL A DRAFT)

This is the guidelines on drawing arrows. The purpose of this guideline is to speed up analysis, make analysis much more clear, eliminate guesswork, and to create consistency of arrow usage.

How to draw:

Green
Hold Right-click

Blue
Alt + Hold Right-click

Red
Shift + Hold Right-click

Orange
Shift + Alt + Hold Right-Click } { [%csl Ya4,Yh4,Rg4,Rb4,Bc4,Bf4,Gd4,Ge4][%cal Ge3e4,Gd3d4,Bf3f4,Bc3c4,Rb3b4,Rg3g4,Yh3h4,Ya3a4] }
 *


