{ Red Arrows usage:
1. To show the opponent's threats!

Red Circle usage:
1. To highlight weak squares
2. To highlight threatening squares

Example:

In the Fried Liver,
The opponent is threatening to take the weak f7 pawn. } { [%csl Rf7][%cal Rg5f7,Rc4f7] }
 *


